{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です^_^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？のMVに\n少しですが映ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら探して見てねん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\n22歳でOLやってるんですが、\nまだまだ制服はイケますかね？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イケると信じてる...！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけで！\n昨日は久しぶりの握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方2部制になってから\n初めての個別握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方々に来て頂いて\n本当に嬉しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巻下ろし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服は、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モスグリーンのニットに\nハイウエストパンツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニットに付いてるパールに\n合わせて\nピアスもパールにしたよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか地味かな？\nって思ってたんだけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『大人っぽい』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と\n意外にも好評で嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり秋が1番好きだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服も季節も。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モスグリーンとか\nマスタードとか\nボルドーとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋い色味が可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして肌寒くなる気候で\nニットとか着る感じが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものすごく好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いな～可愛いな～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ秋服全然買ってないから\n買いにいきたいっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと！\n話が逸れた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の握手会は\n本当に本当に久しぶりだったから\n始まる前、なんだか緊張してて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクしててもソワソワ\n髪の毛やっててもソワソワ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋では終始落ち着きが\nありませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね！始まってみたら、\n皆さん変わらない笑顔で\n会いにきてくれて\nとっても楽しめました*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会わない間に\nたくさんのことがあったから\nいろんな事を話したくて\n時間足りなかったな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり握手会は楽しい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私ですが\nこれからもいろんな話を\n出来たらなって思ってますので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずーっとよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の京都も楽しみ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけで、\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型お揃い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/14/0661993/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん(166cm)\nわたし(164.5cm)に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"囚われた御寧々。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人の卒業に関しては\nまた今度。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は笑顔で見送る事が出来るよう\n泣かない方法をいろいろ考えてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな3人なだけに、\n背中を押したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと1カ月。"}],"source":"archive"}